    description: "Phase 2 (TDD). Extract: (1) operators from 'operator_definition' nodes, name via find_child_by_type(node, 'identifier'). (2) constants from 'constant_declaration' — each 'identifier' child is a separate symbol. (3) variables from 'variable_declaration' — each 'identifier' child is a separate symbol. Key: use 'identifier' nodes (not 'identifier_ref') for declarations. Write tests: test_detect_operator, test_detect_zero_param_operator, test_detect_constants, test_detect_variables. Ref: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tla_plan.md §Symbol Extraction"  # b99e
